# The render image's context is the repository (infra/render/Dockerfile). Not
# the root .dockerignore: that one leaves out `tests/`, where the recorders
# live (apps/www/tests/record). Only what a checkout carries goes in; what a
# local install or build left behind is made again inside the image.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out
**/target
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.eslintcache
